        "text_ixMEXr": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>While many software options exist for creating graphics, brochures, and similar materials, we directly support only professional applications capable of producing the high-quality output required for commercial printing.</p><p>If your project was created with software not listed below, we may still be able to use it. Most programs can produce PostScript output, which can be distilled into a PDF. Many also allow you to export your work in other usable formats, such as EPS or high-resolution TIFF files.</p><p>However, we cannot guarantee the output quality from unsupported programs. You may need to contact the software vendor for help exporting your project in a format suitable for commercial printing. This list is not exhaustive—it simply reflects the formats we work with most often. If you’re unsure whether we can use your files or have any questions, please contact a Customer Service Representative.</p>",
            "subtext_color": false
          }
        }
